WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:04.487
Cora held onto the crab.

2
00:00:04.488 --> 00:00:07.343
"Let me go!" he yelled.

3
00:00:07.344 --> 00:00:11.316
"Leave us alone," Cora said.

4
00:00:11.317 --> 00:00:15.145
"Okay!" the crab said.

5
00:00:15.146 --> 00:00:19.724
Cora let go, and the crab crawled away.

6
00:00:19.725 --> 00:00:26.007
"Don't come back!" Cora said.

7
00:00:26.008 --> 00:00:31.230
She swam to the crack.

8
00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:37.006
"Mo?" Cora called. "Did you find Sal?"

9
00:00:37.007 --> 00:00:44.341
"Yes!" Mo said. "But she's hurt!"

10
00:00:44.342 --> 00:00:49.250
Cora found a bigger crack and slipped inside.

11
00:00:49.251 --> 00:00:51.276
It was very dark.

12
00:00:51.277 --> 00:00:55.690
"Mo, where are you?" Cora said.

13
00:00:55.691 --> 00:00:58.435
"Over here!" Mo said.

14
00:00:58.436 --> 00:01:02.078
"Sal broke her tail!" Sasha said.

15
00:01:02.079 --> 00:01:09.425
"Oh no!" Cora swam over.

16
00:01:09.426 --> 00:01:16.940
Sal was crying. "I miss Hal.

17
00:01:16.941 --> 00:01:20.529
And my tail hurts."

18
00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:24.760
"Sasha, can you get Hal?" Cora asked.

19
00:01:24.761 --> 00:01:30.904
"Me?" Sasha said. "But I'm slow."

20
00:01:30.905 --> 00:01:34.395
"You escaped the crab," Mo said.

21
00:01:34.396 --> 00:01:38.945
"Going backward makes you fast!" Cora said.

22
00:01:38.946 --> 00:01:44.685
Sasha took off.

23
00:01:44.686 --> 00:01:53.610
Soon Sasha returned with Hal.

24
00:01:53.611 --> 00:01:57.641
"You found Sal! Thank you!" Hal said.

25
00:01:57.642 --> 00:02:00.750
The seahorse swam to his mate.

26
00:02:00.751 --> 00:02:03.862
"I'll wrap your tail," Hal said.

27
00:02:03.863 --> 00:02:14.930
"Then we'll find the herd."

28
00:02:14.931 --> 00:02:17.984
The seahorses swam away.

29
00:02:17.985 --> 00:02:21.080
"Thanks, Sasha," Cora said.

30
00:02:21.081 --> 00:02:27.191
Mo nodded. "You swam so fast!"

31
00:02:27.192 --> 00:02:31.954
Sasha did a backward loop. "I sure did!"

